Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: bfd/coffgen.c
Line: 2509
Function: coff_find_nearest_line_with_names
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: Dereferences the result of coff_section_from_bfd_index(abfd, p2->u.syment.n_scnum) without checking for NULL. A malformed file can provide an invalid section index (>0 but out of range), causing coff_section_from_bfd_index to return NULL and leading to a NULL dereference when accessing ->vma.

